Jab b client server pr request krta ha tu wo request event quene mei ja k quene hu jati ha, jitni b request ati jaiy gi wo equent quene me ja k quene huti jai gi,us k bad ye request event loop k pas jai gi.Event loop is a loop which allways watches our event quene to check that if any request need to be implemented.It works on first come first serve service(Jis ki request phly aiy gi usy phly serve kiya jai ga).Har request 2 tariqy ki hu skti ha 
a)Blocking requests   b)Non blocking request

See event loop Pic

Blocking operation also known as synchronous task while non Blocking operation also known as asynchronous task .Event loop jesy he kis request ko utati ha tu it checks that upcoming request is blocking or non blocking.If the request is non blocking,it will process that request and send response to the client.NOw,if it is blocking request,then to process that request,it moves to thread pool.Thread pool is a phol which have different threads.These threads are responsible to process our blocking request(ye in threads ki he duty huti ha in non blocking request ko handle krna ).You can assume a thread as  a worker(Aisa worker jo apk liye kam krta ha).Har request k liye ek thread ko assign kiya jata ha.So whenever a blocking request appears,it demand for a thread to thread pool.Normally thread hamary pas limited he huty ha(by default only 4 threads are avaiable).If any thread is avaiable,then us request k sath us thread ko assign kr dia jata ha.Jab b request process hu jai gi tu hamara thread/worker again thread pool mei a jai ga aur result ko return kr dy ga.Jesy he result hamary pas aiy ga ,hum wo response user ko send kr dy gy. See Blocking Thread Pool.png image 

now let suppose thread pool mei hamary sary threads dosri requests k sath busy thy,ab ek new upcoming request aai,usny thread/worker ki demand ki mgr all the threads are busy,tu is liye hamari request wait kary gi until any thread is free. jesy he koi thread free hu ga ,that free thread will be assigned to that request

Now see the issues in blocking requests.If you are making a web application and you have made a blocking operations,and multiple users hit that blocking requests, then imagine what would be the result,it has to be wait for a long time.So allwas try to make non blocking operations 

